  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::MuseumExhibit
  title: 'On the Wrist: Wearables'
  meta: "Smartwatches  \xB7  Apple Watch released April 2015"
  body: "Smartwatches moved the computer from the pocket onto the skin. Their optical
    sensors read your pulse, their motion sensors count steps and detect falls, and
    some can record a simple electrocardiogram. The device no longer only serves
    you \u2014 it constantly measures you."
  themeLink: 'This is the ''body and technology'' room: the boundary between tool
    and body starts to blur. Measuring a body is also the first step to keeping one
    alive in space.'
  credit: 'Model: "Watch" by Poly by Google, CC BY 3.0, via Poly Pizza. A generic
    watch, not a specific product.'
