  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::MuseumExhibit
  title: MacBook Pro (laptop)
  meta: "Apple Inc.  \xB7  First MacBook Pro announced January 2006"
  body: "A laptop folds a whole desktop computer \u2014 screen, keyboard, battery
    and processor \u2014 into something you can carry under your arm. Work, study
    and making art stopped needing a fixed desk: a caf\xE9, a train or a dorm bed
    could become an office or a studio."
  themeLink: After the phone in your pocket comes the computer in your bag. Technology
    starts following people wherever they go, instead of people going to the machine.
  credit: 'Model: "Laptop / MacBook Pro" by Alex Safayan, CC BY 3.0, via Poly Pizza.
    Simplified low-poly model.'
